title Caravan conclude -- a reader's ending is kept for the run after
prompt autonomous loop -- take the next agent-doable lap Lindy-first crux-first, Standfast on reds, send each finished increment
think Read Kyri and Radiant Style first, then REMEMBER, then the top rows of the session-log index and the newest recommend. The thread is unambiguous: the Caravan correspondence ladder, and the last lap named its own next door -- a reader who lets the wall stand has ended the matter, and nothing tells the run after this one that the correspondence closed rather than merely stopped.
think Standfast first. Every living row in crux/REDS.md reads CLOSED, so the line runs rather than halts. Rota slot 14 this lap: the two style guides, Radiant read whole and Twilight deep-read for the register it holds in reserve.
think The name took four candidates. `adjourn` greps zero yet reads as suspend-until-later, which is the opposite of the act. `cease` is what `desist` already does. `close_out` is a compound where a plain word will serve. `conclude` appears in the tree only as ordinary English in two unrelated modules, names the act exactly, and passes the Comlink tendency's three tests -- clear, fun, safe.
think Designed the tier as the mirror of the rung below rather than a new shape. `abate` acts on `takes_up` and moves a wall; `conclude` acts on `accepts` and moves nothing except a record. Between the two, every word a reader can hand back now moves the plan, each in its own direction -- and `check_conclude` proves the two read that word differently rather than claiming it.
think Chose the ordering from the arc's own discipline, with one deliberate difference. The closure is addressed to a run that has not started, so unlike every other note this rung keeps it does not fall with the records beneath it -- the same reasoning the forbearance five tiers down already earned.
think The mismatch guard needed care. The first cut compared the closure against the record it was built from, which is a tautology dressed as a check. Replaced it with `closes_call`, weighing the record's leading bytes against the call now standing in the reader's own box -- the same shape `abates_wall` uses one tier down.
obs The four bodies the last lap predicted would lift came due exactly on schedule. `check_answer_measure` and `check_answer_wire` were one body per rung until a rung was born above `abate`; born it was, they agreed, and both lifted whole beside `check_abate` and its refusals. `check_abate_measure` and `check_abate_wire` take the terminal seat in their place.
obs A whole new rung landed and the carry did not move: 47 lines, exactly where two laps have now left it, across 99 modules and 1,183 checks. Fold C promised a rung costs the ladder only its own new checks, and two births in a row have now read the meter and found it standing still.
obs REDS %99 -- the lift rewrote fifteen sentences a person reads, and the module compiled and printed GREEN over every one of them. An identifier regex cannot tell code from prose, so `standing` became `rung.standing` inside nine printed lines and six comments. Zig sees nothing to object to in a string literal. The only thing in the tree that could catch it was one witness asserting on an exact sentence rather than on the rung's GREEN, and it named the fault in one read.
obs Closed the red as a wall rather than a repair. `tools/fixtures/caravan_ladder_harness_prose_scan.sh` refuses any `rung.` standing inside a literal or a comment in the harness, and the copy meter pulls it every lap so it is never a scan nobody runs. Three paths on metal: the living harness passes, the elder harness with eighty-odd bodies already lifted passes -- which is what proves it welcomes valid input -- and a control planted from the living harness is refused by line number in both forms.
obs The pair runs the reader's other word for the first time in the arc. Every rung from `beckon` up seated `takes_up`; this one seats `accepts`, so the acceptance branch runs end to end and the abating below correctly moves nothing. That reads as 0 against 0 where the rung below read 1 against 0, and it is the honest reading rather than a gap -- `AbateUnreleased` seen from its welcoming side, in the live path rather than only in the fold.
obs Six self-test reads had to be retailed rather than copied, and that is where the rung is honest. A run that expected a wall gone now reads one standing; a run that expected an abatement now reads none; and the record's own word reads `accepts` where it read `takes_up`. Each is a claim about this branch rather than a copy of the branch below.
obs Docs moved in the same commit rather than a later sweep: the README's new section, its meter numbers, the terminal-seat paragraph that predicted this very lift, and the witness's own claim line, which had said six RED paths where seven now stand.
loom witness=caravan_suite_witness rungs=93 wall_s=310 verdict=GREEN cold_tree=yes
loom meter=caravan_ladder_copy carried_lines=47 prior=47 modules=99 checks=1183 fold_a=835 fold_b=77 fold_c_stubs=0
loom guard=caravan_ladder_harness_prose comments=337 literals=879 verdict=OK red_paths=2
file caravan/conclude.rye the rung -- the Conclude word, its five refusals, the eleven-byte closure, and the note addressed to the run after this one
file caravan/ladder_checks.rye four now-shared bodies lifted: check_answer_measure, check_answer_wire, check_abate, check_abate_refusals -- and fifteen sentences repaired from the lift that carried them
file caravan/abate.rye the same four bodies removed; the rung reaches them through the harness and stays GREEN
file tools/caravan_conclude_witness.rish the rung's own witness -- eleven bytes read off the wire, the wall read as standing, a planted control proving the read
file tools/fixtures/caravan_ladder_harness_prose_scan.sh the loom REDS %99 earned -- no lifted body carries the harness's parameter name into prose
file tools/caravan_ladder_copy_witness.rish the prose guard wired in beside the folds; fold A 796 to 835, fold B 73 to 77, the carry unmoved at 47
file tools/caravan_suite_witness.rish conclude registered, the choir 93 rungs
file caravan/README.md the conclude section, the meter numbers, and the terminal-seat paragraph that came due
file crux/REDS.md REDS %99 booked and closed with a witness on metal
recommend keep-going the correspondence arc is whole in one direction: a plan stands a boundary, carries it to a person, hears them, and now moves on either word they hand back. The next constructive door is the far side of the closure -- a run that finds one standing should inherit a matter already ended rather than opening the whole correspondence afresh, which is the shape `mind` wore for the forbearance five tiers down. The carry stands at 47 against a ceiling of 4,000, so the ladder still costs a rung nothing but its own checks.
